        "7.8.13 端口参数",
        "7.8.13.1 RS485"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.13.1 RS485",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "当数据采集器串口连接设备时，该串口端口波特率、校验位以及停止位必须与所连接\n设备配置相同，才能保证数据采集器与所连设备正常通讯。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        114.562,
        555.545,
        447.562,
        577.298
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-E9211BE6C49D54E9",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 82,
      "printed_page_label": "72",
      "block_order": 25,
      "section_id": "SEC-AEFF73622A77CE54",
      "section_path": [
        "7 Web界面",
        "7.8 系统",
        "7.8.13 端口参数",
        "7.8.13.1 RS485"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.13.1 RS485",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "仅当COM1~COM7 端口接入设备时，才能将COM1~COM7 端口对应的PLC 接入\n状态设置为使能，设置使能后，COM1~COM7 端口对应的波特率将自动修改为\n115200，此时可对PLC 节点参数进行设置，具体参见7.8.14 MPLC（宽带PLC）。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        114.562,
        598.145,
        447.472,
        630.698
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
